# Keep the docker build context lean and PLATFORM-CORRECT:
#  - node_modules: COPY . . after npm ci would overwrite the image's linux
#    node_modules with the host's darwin tree (esbuild/rollup native binaries)
#  - out/: local Remotion renders (~160MB of MP4s, git-ignored but NOT
#    docker-ignored by .gitignore)
node_modules
out
dist
.DS_Store
*.log
